WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:07,610
In that direction is the ground flag team's target?

2
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:24,820
He said there was a bad copper in the back

3
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,620
I've been chasing you all the way here

4
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:28,020
That's no ordinary pigeon

5
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:29,580
He put it back after putting it on

6
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:31,790
Everyone stays in touch

7
00:00:31,790 --> 00:00:32,790
don't let him get close

8
00:00:32,790 --> 00:00:40,940
Threat removed

9
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,540
Continue to wait for other pigeons to return
